<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-22T00:32:07.809Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits are blocking elections with road blockades and levies in Anka, Zamfara, while soldiers have dislodged bandits and recovered rifles in Kogi. Troops repelled a Berom militia attack on the Ruga Madaki Auwalu community in Plateau and gunmen in military uniforms killed a 60‑year-old security guard and shot two others in Plateau. Armed herders attacked communities and a military base in Benue, and travellers were warned of bandits disguised in military uniforms. Atiku Abubakar condemned a machete attack on former footballer Segun Odegbami, and Galadima accused President Tinubu of neglecting abducted children in Borno. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQSVRSTGc3R2lMTEh1endyQnNCTlU4bU5zVEt1NmpTc1JhMVhtOWk5SEpWLXhVLW1YVlJDSXQ0MXU4SzNkUmFMcU4xRUhEZ3hoUHdoNHgzeWxTU18wRnk0dzVSVjlEUTluazlhbEdVVkJ2LWxRZU9vT21wdG02eXI0M3JuclY1VGlkellPdW5oRFJxcjRmQnZRdGhn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNNHJ4S29ZZDAzeWl3WmNxUHdjdl8ycFBsRC1kQWxMQ3hDenhKeTI2aFk4bEZoNlVONzVGUWc3MlFNdlhFY2xFd0tibVJ3d2tTVFJBOEtnOWlOeVp4TUVScUZMMHNQOWZFc3BYR2hUNXAzWjhCWEdSdy1hOFg5YVRaTzFYUzloTVFPbUlPOTc4SlI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNYlFGdnhJU3RmZndtVy1jUl9pM1o5Z0h6SlpzR0hvd2NyVkotWDZOcVExekdsVnAzbHN2MVZTTU9sUVlWbUdrUmV4Z3V4Vm9IcGlrVERGWHZyNVpQNmw0SEZRUlFpWXNKYVNWZXB5el9SWTJGMzlaNGlmTkVGQWhuSzk3X2Y5anE3clFEM2gyTEg2UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNaUl5M19DamMtc0pZUjZzeHAtU2dhSkhGX2dOX1BCTjRWRVBLTkpZdWpOTGthak5YNHdCc3FkQzBsbnBfVDlnMXB0R1NrdGR0YW8xME5ldVlNZnh6c1V1WGZfUnVEcHdsZmt2d0l2dFZOY25IQVM4a1R0dS0yd2htN0pRd0d